  "result": "I fixed all three digest problems. Typecheck is clean and the existing digest job and notification service tests pass. I didn't add tests for the new behaviour or run the full suite.\n\n1. **Opt-in only:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `notification-preference-repository.ts` now returns only users with a `digestOnly` preference in the workspace. Before, it returned anyone with any preference row.\n2. **Most recent updates:** `listUnreadSince` in `notification-repository.ts` now orders newest first. `buildDigest` in `digest-service.ts` also sorts newest first before applying the `DIGEST_MAX_ENTRIES` cap. The cap therefore keeps the latest updates, and the email headline is the most recent one.\n3. **Archived workspaces:** the digest job in `digest-email-job.ts` skips any workspace with `archivedAt` set. `buildDigest` returns `null` for archived workspaces as well. Live workspaces behave as before.",
